    // The Material Fabricator turns energy into material, as far as its upkeep is paid
    // (mc-sim mines.rs `fabricator_income`). One 2x2 building from tech 2, upgraded in
    // place to tech 3. Small and many: two eat a Reactor II, four a Reactor III, so a
    // player adds them a few at a time rather than saving up for one. Still worth it
    // after the mine upgrades (3 / 7 / 11 min): T2 1.5/s pays back in ~13 min, T3 5/s
    // in ~10, with their share of a reactor. Adjacency (mc-sim adjacency.rs): a reactor
    // against it cuts its upkeep, and it cuts the materials of what a factory against it builds.
    // A fabricator and a reactor of its tier that touch go down together: kill one and
    // the other goes up with it.
    (
        key: "aster_t2_fabricator",
        name: "Material Fabricator II",
